# Normalize line endings for every text file: LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
#
# This is not cosmetic here. Agent CLI materializes executor worktrees with git and compares
# captured bytes against the parent workspace; when a machine's `core.autocrlf=true` smudges an
# LF tree to CRLF on checkout, every captured file is refused at apply as base drift. The
# runtime works around that case (see `probeEolPin` in src/git/worktree.ts), but attributes beat
# `core.*` config, so pinning it here removes the class rather than compensating for it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets, never normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
